2026-09-24T00:30:43.2920933Z   version: 14
2026-09-24T00:30:43.2921363Z local_conf_header:
2026-09-24T00:30:43.2921559Z   mirror: |
2026-09-24T00:30:43.2921908Z     SSTATE_MIRRORS = "file://.* http://sstate.yoctoproject.org/all/PATH;downloadfilename=PATH"
2026-09-24T00:30:43.2922252Z   ccache: |
